# Build context is the repo root, but the Dockerfile only COPYs src/ and global.json. Keep
# everything else out — notably any local SQLite database (birth data, journal) and .env.
*
!global.json
!src/

# Local build outputs, dependencies and data, rebuilt (or mounted) inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
src/frontend/dist
src/frontend/.angular
src/backend/Dendera.Api/wwwroot
